Package: fdtp
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: zip, unzip, lhasa, dosfstools, libheif1, libheif-plugin-libde265
Suggests: uim-mozc | uim-anthy, python3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: file manager in the style of FD 3.13, for the Pomera DM250
 FDTP follows the screens and keys of FD 3.13, the file manager many
 people used on the NEC PC-98. It runs on the DRM/KMS console and in an
 X11 window. It has viewers for text, hex, PDF, docx, xlsx, csv, pptx and
 images, a PDF menu, tar, zip and LHa archives, and a novel editor for
 Japanese manuscripts.
 .
 fdtp-pomera-setup makes the optional settings for the King Jim Pomera
 DM250 (Wi-Fi stabilization and a read-only mount of the internal memory).
